#. module: sn_wsd_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sn_wsd_sale/models/stock_picking_prn.py:0
msgid ""
"Please inspect the goods within 3 days of the delivery, then sign and stamp "
"this sheet and send it back to us."
msgstr "货到3天内客户应对产品进行验收，验收无误后请签字、盖章并将本单回传我司。"

#. module: sn_wsd_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sn_wsd_sale/models/stock_picking_prn.py:0
msgid ""
"The goods are taken as accepted when this sheet is not sent back within 3 "
"days of the delivery. Damage caused by the transport has to be reported to "
"us within 7 days of the delivery."
msgstr "若收到产品3日内未回传本单即视为默认收货。如运输造成的破损请在7日内向我司提出。"

#. module: sn_wsd_sale
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sn_wsd_sale/models/stock_picking_prn.py:0
msgid ""
"We answer such a claim within 3 days. Beyond that delay we carry no risk of "
"the transport."
msgstr "我司在3日内给予回复。逾期我司不承担任何运输造成的风险。"

